[NARRATIVE]
UID: NAR-SEMANTIC-LAYER-LEGEND
TITLE: How to read the colours
DEPTH: sketch
AUTHORED_BY: llm
WIDGET: legend
STATEMENT: >>>
Colour is only ever a tag, and every tag is written out beside it.

- WORKS: green: stands as written under the current direction
- FALLS OUT: slate: dissolved; the direction replaces it with something already in the model
- UNADDRESSED: amber: the direction is silent on it
- OPEN: blue: an open decision owns it
- GAP: red: needed, and nobody has written it
<<<
